    "searchCoverage": "Official EODHD REST API is GET https://eodhd.com/api/{path} with api_token query authentication. GET /user is the documented account probe used by the pinned credential validator and is used as healthcheck rather than instrument search. GET /exchanges-list, GET /real-time/{ticker}, and GET /eod/{ticker} are documented reads. Quote and EOD default to CSV, so native always sends fmt=json. Operator is Unicorn Data Services SAS in Lyon, France. HTTP 200 bodies may carry message or error; native bodyErrorPaths demote those to failures. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying EODHD platform compromise. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
    "incidents": [],
