      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "ticker is a required path segment on documented GET /real-time/{ticker}. Native always sends fmt=json because the documented default is CSV.",
        "additionalTickers and exchange filters are omitted; comma-joined s= lists are not expressed by native query templates.",
